<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <%- include('partials/theme-init') %>
  <title>Kuruk Cloud — Gateways de pagamento</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo_kuruk-icon.png">
  <%- include('partials/styles') %>
  <style>
    .gateway-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .gateway-card {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
    }
    .gateway-logo {
      width: 46px; height: 46px; flex: none; border-radius: 13px;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, #00b1ea 12%, var(--surface));
      color: #00a3d9; font-weight: 900; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: -.03em;
    }
    .gateway-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .gateway-body h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }
    .gateway-body p { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
    .gateway-meta { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
    .gateway-meta .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .gateway-meta .pill.on { background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--primary); }
    .gateway-meta .pill.off { background: var(--surface-hover); color: var(--muted); }
    .gateway-meta .pill.warn { background: #fff4e5; color: #b45309; }
    .gateway-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
    .gateway-placeholder {
      border-style: dashed; background: transparent; box-shadow: none;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .gateway-placeholder .gateway-logo { background: var(--surface-hover); color: var(--muted); }
    .gateway-note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .gateway-card { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .gateway-actions { width: 100%; }
      .gateway-actions .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar', { active: 'gateways' }) %>
    <main class="content">
      <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: 'gateways' }) %>
      <div class="page">
        <div class="page-header">
          <h1>Gateways de pagamento</h1>
          <p class="field-hint" style="margin-top:0">
            Provedores que podem receber a assinatura do Kuruk. O Mercado Pago é o gateway ativo
            hoje; a lista abaixo já está preparada para receber outros provedores no futuro.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gateway-list">
          <section class="gateway-card">
            <span class="gateway-logo">MP</span>
            <div class="gateway-body">
              <h2>Mercado Pago</h2>
              <p>Pix, boleto e cartão. Também é o gateway das assinaturas recorrentes (preapproval).</p>
              <div class="gateway-meta">
                <% if (gateway.enabled && gateway.accessTokenSet) { %>
                  <span class="pill on">Ativo</span>
                <% } else if (gateway.accessTokenSet) { %>
                  <span class="pill warn">Credencial salva, gateway desligado</span>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="pill off">Não configurado</span>
                <% } %>
                <% if (gateway.accessTokenSet) { %>
                  <span class="pill <%= gateway.environment === 'producao' ? 'on' : 'off' %>">
                    <%= gateway.environment === 'producao' ? 'Produção' : (gateway.environment === 'teste' ? 'Teste' : 'Ambiente desconhecido') %>
                  </span>
                  <% if (gateway.accountEmail) { %><span class="pill off"><%= gateway.accountEmail %></span><% } %>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gateway-actions">
              <a class="btn" href="/admin/payments"><%= gateway.accessTokenSet ? 'Configurar' : 'Configurar gateway' %></a>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="gateway-card gateway-placeholder">
            <span class="gateway-logo">+</span>
            <div class="gateway-body">
              <h2>Outro gateway</h2>
              <p>Estrutura pronta para adicionar novos provedores de pagamento quando fizer sentido.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gateway-actions">
              <button type="button" class="btn secondary" disabled>Em breve</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <p class="gateway-note">
          Cada gateway tem credenciais próprias e aparece como uma linha nesta lista. O app do
          cliente não vê essas chaves: ele só recebe o resultado do pagamento pelo cloud.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
